# KI-004: Grinding an existing catalyst changes its future activity, not past yield
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H2O2 0.001mol
add v1 MnO2 0.002g
grind v1 MnO2 300um
wait 15s
inspect v1
grind v1 MnO2 30um
inspect v1
wait 15s
inspect v1
inspect
